+/****************************************************************
+*Description:skw_sdio_reset_card
+*Func:used the ap boot cp interface;
+*Calls:boot data
+*Call By:the ap host
+*Input:the boot data informations
+*Output:the dloader the bin to cp
+*Return：0:pass; other : fail
